    "created_at": "2016-04-04T12:42:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-04T12:42:46Z",
    "body": "HTTP state (and active CSP) seems like something that is tied to the place where the blob is created. I think we ought to be storing a few bits of information on the blob when it's created, and persist those through whenever it's instantiated/requested. \n",
